    <subfield code="a">"Pathways is a limited edition artist's book exploring the interior landscape of a relationship in flux. The organic shapes within the pages hint at both neurology and geography. Turning the pages echoes the experience of focusing a microscope, layer by layer on a dense, complex slide."--Artist's website, viewed Mar. 16, 2012.</subfield>
  </datafield>
